id: lesson.consolidation
category: lesson
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: Frequent patterns should be consolidated into permanent procedural memories (skills). One-time fixes are temporary; encoded patterns are permanent.
notes: |
  Pattern frequency → procedural memory (skill)
  One-time fixes → working memory (temporary)
  Skills are reusable across sessions and cycles
  The ReflectionEngine should identify patterns worth consolidating
  SynthesisEngine should recommend skill creation for recurring patterns
tags: [consolidation, skills, procedural-memory, patterns, permanence]
